Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Admission Services recently received an application fee waiver from your school. However, the application fee waiver submitted was incomplete and missing information. Please request a new fee waiver from your high school counselor and make sure all fields are filled out completely. We will then be able to review your application fee waiver.

Let me know if you have any additional questions about the admission process.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

